  <p>Hard water deposits and years of daily use wear out cartridges, o-rings, and diverters. If your shower leaks behind the wall, runs hot-only or cold-only, or never fully switches to the handheld, our techs identify the valve type and fix or replace components with as little tile disruption as possible.</p>
